{'symbol': 'NOC', 'date': '2019-11-15 22:30:00', 'title': 'U.S. Air Force Selects Northrop Grumman Corporation for a Prototype Project', 'text': "Northrop Grumman Corporation has been selected by the U.S. Air Force for a prototype project to demonstrate an internally mounted electronic warfare suite and digital radar warning receiver for the F-16 fighter aircraft. The agreement was issued under SOSSEC Consortium's Air Force Open System Acquisition Initiative (OSAI) Other Transaction Agreement (OTA) for prototyping. Northrop Grumman to Demonstrate Electronic Warfare Suite Prototype for US Air Force F-16 Fighter. Northrop Grumman will demonstrate an advanced electronic warfare suite and digital radar warning receiver prototypes for the U.S. Air Force F-16 fighter."}
{'symbol': 'NVDA', 'date': '2019-11-15 21:30:00', 'title': 'Nvidia Reports Q3 Earnings Per Share $1.45', 'text': 'NVIDIA ANNOUNCES FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR THIRD QUARTER FISCAL 2020.Q3 NON-GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE $1.78.Q3 GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE $1.45.Q3 REVENUE $3.01 BILLION VERSUS REFINITIV IBES ESTIMATE OF $2.91 BILLION.Q3 EARNINGS PER SHARE ESTIMATE $1.57 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.Q4 REVENUE IS EXPECTED TO BE $2.95 BILLION, PLUS OR MINUS 2 PERCENT.QTRLY GAAP GROSS MARGIN 63.6% VERSUS 60.4% REPORTED LAST YEAR.Q4 GAAP AND NON-GAAP GROSS MARGINS EXPECTED TO BE 64.1 PERCENT AND 64.5 PERCENT, RESPECTIVELY, PLUS OR MINUS 50 BASIS POINTS.QTRLY NON-GAAP GROSS MARGIN 64.1% VERSUS 61.0% REPORTED LAST YEAR.Q4 GAAP AND NON-GAAP OPERATING EXPENSES ARE EXPECTED TO BE APPROXIMATELY $1.02 BILLION AND $805 MILLION, RESPECTIVELY.Q4 GAAP AND NON-GAAP OTHER INCOME AND EXPENSE ARE BOTH EXPECTED TO BE INCOME OF APPROXIMATELY $25 MILLION..Q4 REVENUE VIEW $3.06 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.SAYS "OUR GAMING BUSINESS AND DEMAND FROM HYPERSCALE CUSTOMERS POWERED Q3\'S RESULTS".WILL RETURN TO REPURCHASING ITS STOCK AFTER CLOSING ACQUISITION OF MELLANOX TECHNOLOGIES.WILL PAY ITS NEXT QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.16 PER SHARE ON DEC. 20, 2019, TO ALL SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON NOV. 29, 2019.BELIEVES MELLANOX DEAL CLOSING WILL LIKELY OCCUR IN EARLY PART OF CALENDAR 2020.Q4 REVENUE VIEW $3.06 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.DISCUSSIONS REGARDING MELLANOX DEAL WITH EU AND CHINA REGULATORY BODIES ARE PROGRESSING.CLOSING THE ACQUISITION IS POSSIBLE BY END OF THIS CALENDAR YEAR.'}
